### CHAT STREAM (SSE)
# REST Client shows the response only after the stream ends; use curl -N to watch it live.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/chat/stream?conversationId=ef0d5982-d526-4062-956c-a1db81ca7d53
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "prompt": "Como se fosse um profissional senior me explique como o react native funciona por baixo dos panos (CHEAP MODEL)"
}

