### UPLOAD ONE ITERATION OF DOCUMENT
POST {{baseUrl}}/rag/documents?conversationId=ef0d5982-d526-4062-956c-a1db81ca7d53
Cookie: {{cookie}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="prot.docx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document

< ./prot.docx
--MyBoundary--

### Get Document upload status
GET {{baseUrl}}/rag/documents/29329aa6-7c2f-4460-8445-246ac67a9d05
Cookie: {{cookie}}


### Retrieve argument
GET {{baseUrl}}/rag/search?query=Fatecard
Cookie: {{cookie}}


### QUTA
GET {{baseUrl}}/usage
Cookie: {{cookie}}


### ASSESSMENT: generate (header and theme are optional)
# @name assessment
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "prompt": "Prova de Ciências para o 6º ano sobre o sistema solar: 4 questões objetivas de 1 ponto e 2 dissertativas de 3 pontos.",
    "header": {
        "institutionName": "Escola Exemplo",
        "teacherName": "Prof. Exemplo",
        "subject": "Ciências"
    },
    "theme": {
        "accentColor": "#1d4ed8"
    }
}

### ASSESSMENT: stored JSON
@assessmentId = {{assessment.response.body.id}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ASSESSMENT: HTML preview
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/preview
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ASSESSMENT: PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/pdf
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ASSESSMENT: answer key PDF
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/answer-key
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ASSESSMENT: answer key HTML preview
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/answer-key/preview
Cookie: {{cookie}}

### ASSESSMENT: manual patch (no AI). "version" is the one from the last response; ids come from the stored JSON
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "version": 1,
    "ops": [
        { "op": "set_title", "title": "Prova Bimestral de Ciências" },
        { "op": "update_theme", "theme": { "baseFontSizePt": 14, "numbering": "continuous" } },
        { "op": "update_header_fields", "fields": { "score": false } }
    ]
}

### ASSESSMENT: AI revision (the AI returns a patch)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/revise
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "version": 2,
    "instruction": "Adicione mais uma questão objetiva de 1 ponto sobre a Lua no final da primeira seção."
}

### ASSESSMENT: regenerate the content (keeps header and theme; "prompt" is optional)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/regenerate
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
    "version": 3
}
